#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "The Titan Tools Center stands out as a multipurpose theme designed to meet the needs of businesses, developers, and creative agencies looking to build a strong online presence, making it ideal for agencies, business sites, tools stores, corporate websites, personal projects, and also hardware supply stores, industrial equipment retailers, mechanical repair shops, automotive tool dealers, construction material suppliers, electrical component stores, DIY craft workshops, plumbing equipment shops, engineering service firms, and manufacturing tool distributors seeking a sleek, modern platform. With its minimal yet elegant design, the theme blends sophistication with clean, modern aesthetics to deliver a user-friendly and retina-ready experience across all devices. Its responsive structure ensures your website looks stunning on desktops, tablets, and smartphones, while the secure, optimized, and lightweight code guarantees faster page load times and smooth performance. Built on the Bootstrap framework, Titan Tools Center offers seamless customization through shortcodes, layout flexibility, and extensive personalization options, allowing users to tailor colors, typography, and design elements to match their brand identity. Engaging features—including testimonial sections, team showcases, banner areas, animated sections, and a strong, strategically placed call-to-action (CTA) button—enhance user interaction and highlight your services effectively. Social media integration keeps your audience connected, while compatibility with essential plugins like Contact Form 7, WooCommerce, Yoast SEO, and Jetpack elevates functionality and performance. SEO-friendly, translation-ready, and developer-approved, the Titan Tools Center theme provides a luxurious, mobile-friendly, and highly versatile design that empowers you to create a beautiful, stunning, and professional website effortlessly."
msgstr ""

